# 结果文件被挪到 recon/ 之后漏网，被提交并 push 到了 GitHub。
.ilearning_cookie.txt
good_cookie.txt
**/raw_cookies.txt
**/state_cdp.json
**/state.json
**/*cookie*.txt
**/*cookie*.json
**/*_token*
**/cookies.txt

# === 运行时产物 ===
sniper*.log
sniper.log.*
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.playwright-cli/

# === 误创建的系统路径字面量目录 ===
# 某些工具会把 %SystemDrive% 当成真实路径，在仓库里生成这种垃圾目录
%SystemDrive%/
%USERPROFILE%/
%TEMP%/

